1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
Fake internship?

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:12,000
They claim you can earn ₹50,000 a month after paying a ₹5,000 registration fee and downloading special software.

3
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:21,000
A video call from a 'police officer' threatens a digital arrest if you don't submit your credentials immediately.

4
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:31,000
Never share OTPs, passwords or bank details. Verify suspicious callers using official contact information.

5
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:40,000
Report financial fraud at cybercrime.gov.in or call the national helpline 1930 for help.

6
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:44,000
Stay safe. Stay smart.
